  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>We&#39;ve just released new Node and PHP versions&nbsp;for Azure App Service on Linux.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For Node, we have added:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>9.4</li>\r\n <li>8.9</li>\r\n <li>8.8</li>\r\n <li>8.2</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>For PHP, we have added:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>7.2</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>​For more details,&nbsp;see the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://blogs.msdn.microsoft.com/appserviceteam/2018/03/05/major-stack-updates-to-node-and-php-on-app-service-on-linux/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">blog post</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "We've just released new Node and PHP versions for Azure App Service on Linux.\n\nFor Node, we have added:\n\n9.4\n\n8.9\n\n8.8\n\n8.2\n\nFor PHP, we have added:\n\n7.2\n\n​For more details, see the blog post ."
